findings.suggested_fix:
Add appropriate permission classes (e.g., IsAuthenticated) and filter the queryset by the requesting user or application. For example:

    class SSFStreamViewSet(...):
        permission_classes = [IsAuthenticated]
        def get_queryset(self):
            return Stream.objects.filter(provider__backchannel_application__owner=self.request.user)

Also ensure delete and retrieve actions check ownership before proceeding.
